ttackers takes 1d6 electrical damage and 2d6 electrical ",{"tag":"a","children":["Stun"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stun"}," damage. Each time an attacker is damaged in this way, the Shockweb discharges 1 minute of duration off its ",{"tag":"a","children":["Energy Cell"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Energy_Cell","referenceId":"reference:a3dedb9c17e4ee9d"},".\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
